WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.946
Nurse 1: We're so glad you came.

2
00:00:16.947 --> 00:00:19.715
Everyone is excited to meet you.

3
00:00:19.716 --> 00:00:21.615
Nurse 2: And your pets!

4
00:00:21.616 --> 00:00:24.968
Nurse 1: Would you like to introduce yourselves?

5
00:00:24.969 --> 00:00:29.190
Riley: Hello, everyone! I'm Riley Summers.

6
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:31.181
And this is Snooks.

7
00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:34.253
Riley: Snooks is a hound dog.

8
00:00:34.254 --> 00:00:37.386
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

9
00:00:37.387 --> 00:00:42.157
Riley: I gave him a bath so he'd be soft and shiny today.

10
00:00:42.158 --> 00:00:46.248
Riley: And Snooks shook water all over everything.

11
00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:50.454
Residents: Ha-ha!

12
00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:54.591
Skyler: I'm Skyler. And this is my parrot, Chatter.

13
00:00:54.592 --> 00:00:58.562
Chatter: Hello. Hello. Cheer up!

14
00:00:58.563 --> 00:01:01.105
Woman: What a cute parrot.

15
00:01:01.106 --> 00:01:03.908
Skyler: Chatter knows lots of words.

16
00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:06.854
Chatter: Cheer up! Do your homework!

17
00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:10.584
Residents: Ha-ha!

18
00:01:10.585 --> 00:01:13.704
Ben: I'm Ben, and this is my turtle, Speedy.

19
00:01:13.705 --> 00:01:15.825
He can roll over.

20
00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:19.650
Ben: But sometimes he can't roll back again.

21
00:01:19.651 --> 00:01:23.703
Sarah: I'm Sarah, and this is Mittens.

22
00:01:23.704 --> 00:01:27.797
Man: It looks like you love Mittens a lot.

23
00:01:27.798 --> 00:01:30.840
Sarah: Mittens is my best friend.

24
00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:33.472
I'd like a real kitten too.

25
00:01:33.473 --> 00:01:37.290
Sarah: But my mom says I'm still too little.

26
00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:42.384
Theo: I'm Theo. And this is Frankie and Whiskers.

27
00:01:42.385 --> 00:01:45.001
Whiskers can play the piano.

28
00:01:45.002 --> 00:01:48.404
Man: Show us!

29
00:01:48.405 --> 00:01:56.319
Theo: Okay. Whiskers, play a tune!

30
00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.476
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

31
00:01:58.477 --> 00:02:00.943
Theo: Frankie wants to sing along.

32
00:02:00.944 --> 00:02:03.555
He likes the music!

33
00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:10.794
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

34
00:02:10.795 --> 00:02:14.137
Riley: Uh-oh, there goes Frankie!

35
00:02:14.138 --> 00:02:18.483
Mrs. Summers: Oh dear! Someone grab him, quick!

36
00:02:18.484 --> 00:02:24.028
Chatter: Uh-oh! Oh dear! Cheer up!

37
00:02:24.029 --> 00:02:27.705
Theo: Frankie, come back!

38
00:02:27.706 --> 00:02:33.068
Sarah: Frankie jumped into the fish tank!
